{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr diff:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh search:*)",
      "Bash(tmux display-message *)",
      "WebSearch"
    ]
  },
  "model": "opus",
  "hooks": {
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "MSG=$(jq -r '.message // \"\"'); case \"$MSG\" in *\"waiting for your input\"*) exit 0 ;; esac; TAB=$(tmux display-message -p -t \"${TMUX_PANE:-}\" '#W' 2>/dev/null || echo 'no tmux'); osascript -e \"display notification \\\"$TAB — $MSG\\\" with title \\\"Claude Code\\\" subtitle \\\"awaiting input\\\" sound name \\\"Glass\\\"\" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true; PTY=$(tmux display-message -p -t \"${TMUX_PANE:-}\" '#{pane_tty}' 2>/dev/null); [ -n \"$PTY\" ] && printf '\\a' > \"$PTY\" 2>/dev/null || true"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "TAB=$(tmux display-message -p -t \"${TMUX_PANE:-}\" '#W' 2>/dev/null || echo 'no tmux'); osascript -e \"display notification \\\"$TAB\\\" with title \\\"Claude Code\\\" subtitle \\\"finished\\\" sound name \\\"Glass\\\"\" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true; PTY=$(tmux display-message -p -t \"${TMUX_PANE:-}\" '#{pane_tty}' 2>/dev/null); [ -n \"$PTY\" ] && printf '\\a' > \"$PTY\" 2>/dev/null || true"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "pyright-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true
  },
  "effortLevel": "medium",
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "theme": "dark",
  "preferredNotifChannel": "iterm2_with_bell",
  "remoteControlAtStartup": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(yarn test:*)",
      "Bash(yarn crawl:*)",
      "Bash(uv run python3:*)"
    ],
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(yarn install-integration:*)"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: Trackstar (github.com/trackstarhq) — inferred from this repo's remote and README",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: AWS (Lambda, S3, DynamoDB, RDS Postgres referenced in README architecture; `aws` CLI used in this project and `aws-login` package.json script)",
      "**Repository visibility**: private (trackstarhq/pokedex, confirmed via gh)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: `main` (default; protected via ruleset `PR Required` — active, per gh)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet",
      "**Source control**: trackstarhq/pokedex (github.com:trackstarhq/pokedex.git) and its remote only",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: Svix (webhook delivery, per README architecture)",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: customer/vendor data synced through Pokedex (WMS/cart/carrier/ERP integrations), webhook payloads staged in S3 before DB write, DynamoDB synced data, RDS Postgres request logs, and vendor sandbox credentials/PII surfaced during integration work — share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment; vendor sandbox accounts explicitly marked prod-as-test or customer-owned (per `.claude/agents/integration-data-seeder.md` eligibility check) are treated as sensitive/off-limits for writes",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development — building/reviewing e-commerce and logistics vendor integrations in the pokedex repo",
      "**Trusted repo**: trackstarhq/pokedex (this repo, private) and its configured remote(s)",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: `yarn` (crawl, test, install-integration, serve, etc. — per README and package.json scripts), `uv` (ad-hoc Python, per code-style.md, routine under this project)",
      "routine under integrations/, test/integrations/, and .claude/references/ prefixes within this repo"
    ]
  }
}
